      "html": "<body>\r\n<cb:mulu level=\"1\" n=\"21\" type=\"品\">21 十行品</cb:mulu><cb:mulu level=\"2\">之一</cb:mulu><cb:div type=\"pin\">\r\n<milestone n=\"20\" unit=\"juan\"/>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0105c13\">0105c13</span>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0105c14\">0105c14</span>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0105c15\">0105c15</span><cb:juan n=\"020\" fun=\"open\"><cb:mulu n=\"020\" type=\"卷\"></cb:mulu><cb:mulu level=\"2\">之二</cb:mulu><cb:jhead><title>大方廣佛華嚴經</title>卷第二十</cb:jhead></cb:juan>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0105c16\">0105c16</span>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0105c17\">0105c17</span><byline><anchor xml:id=\"fxT10p0105c01\"/>于闐國三<anchor xml:id=\"fxT10p0105c02\"/>藏實叉難陀<anchor xml:id=\"fxT10p0105c03\"/>奉　制譯</byline>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0105c18\">0105c18</span><head>十行品第二十一之<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0105002\">二＝下【宋】【元】</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0105002\">二【大】，下【宋】【元】</span><app n=\"0105002\"><p class=\"lg\">二</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【宋】 【元】\">下</rdg></app></head>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0105c19\">0105c19</span><p>「佛子！何等為菩薩摩訶薩無著行？佛子！此菩\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0105c20\">0105c20</span>薩以無著心，於念念中，能入阿僧祇世界，嚴\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0105c21\">0105c21</span>淨阿僧祇世界。於諸世界，心無所著，往詣阿\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0105c22\">0105c22</span>僧祇諸如來所，恭敬禮拜，承事供養。以阿\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0105c23\">0105c23</span>僧祇華、阿僧祇香、阿僧祇鬘，阿僧祇塗香、末\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0105c24\">0105c24</span>香、衣服、珍寶、幢幡、妙蓋，諸莊嚴具各阿僧\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0105c25\">0105c25</span>祇以用供養；如是供養，為究竟無作法故，\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0105c26\">0105c26</span>為住不思議法故。於念念中，見無數佛；於\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0105c27\">0105c27</span>諸佛所，心無所著；於諸佛剎，亦無所著；於佛\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0105c28\">0105c28</span>相好，亦無所著；見佛光明，聽佛說法，亦無所\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0105c29\">0105c29</span>著；於十方世界，及佛菩薩所有眾會，亦無\r\n<p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0106a01\">0106a01</span>所著；聽佛法已，心生歡喜，志力廣大，能攝、能\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0106a02\">0106a02</span>行諸菩薩行，然於佛法，亦無所著。此菩薩\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0106a03\">0106a03</span>於不可說劫，見不可說佛出興於世，一一佛\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0106a04\">0106a04</span>所，承事供養，皆悉盡於不可說劫，心無厭足；\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0106a05\">0106a05</span>見佛聞法，及見菩薩眾會莊嚴，皆無所著；\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0106a06\">0106a06</span>見不淨世界，亦無憎惡。何以故？此菩薩如\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0106a07\">0106a07</span>諸佛法而觀察故。諸佛法中，無垢、無淨、無闇、\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0106a08\">0106a08</span>無明，無異、無一，無實、無妄，無安隱、無險難，無\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0106a09\">0106a09</span>正道、無邪道。菩薩如是深入法界，教化眾生，\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0106a10\">0106a10</span>而於眾生不生執著；受持諸法，而於諸法\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0106a11\">0106a11</span>不生執著；發菩提心，住於佛住，而於佛住不\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0106a12\">0106a12</span>生執著；雖有言說，而於言說心無所著；入眾\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0106a13\">0106a13</span>生趣，於眾生趣心無所著；了知三昧，能入能\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0106a14\">0106a14</span>住，而於三昧心無所著；往詣無量諸佛國土，\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0106a15\">0106a15</span>若入、若見、若於中住，而於佛土心無所著，捨\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0106a16\">0106a16</span>去之時亦無顧戀。菩薩摩訶薩以能如是無\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0106a17\">0106a17</span>所著故，於佛法中，心無障礙，了佛菩提，證法\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0106a18\">0106a18</span>毘尼，住佛正教，修菩薩行，住菩薩心，思惟菩\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0106a19\">0106a19</span>薩解脫之法，於菩薩住處心無所染，於菩薩\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0106a20\">0106a20</span>所行亦無所著，淨菩薩道，受菩薩記；得受記\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0106a21\">0106a21</span>已，作如是念：『凡夫愚癡，無知無見，無信無\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0106a22\">0106a22</span>解，無聰敏行，頑嚚貪著，流轉生死；不求見\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0106a23\">0106a23</span>佛，不隨明導，不信調御，迷誤失錯，入於險\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0106a24\">0106a24</span>道；不敬十力王，不知菩薩恩，戀著住處；聞諸\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0106a25\">0106a25</span>法空，心大驚怖；遠離正法，住於邪法；捨夷坦\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0106a26\">0106a26</span>道，入險難道；棄背佛意，隨逐魔意；於諸有\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0106a27\">0106a27</span>中，堅執不捨。』菩薩如是觀諸眾生，增長大\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0106a28\">0106a28</span>悲，生諸善根而無所著。菩薩爾時復作是\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0106a29\">0106a29</span>念：『我當為一眾生，於十方世界一一國土，\r\n<p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0106b01\">0106b01</span>經不可說不可說劫，教化成熟。如為一眾生，\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0106b02\">0106b02</span>為一切眾生皆亦如是；終不以此而生疲厭，\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0106b03\">0106b03</span>捨而餘去。』又以毛端遍量法界，於一毛端處，\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0106b04\">0106b04</span>盡不可說不可說劫，教化調伏一切眾生；如\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0106b05\">0106b05</span>一毛端處，一一毛端處皆亦如是。乃至不於\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0106b06\">0106b06</span>一彈指頃，執著於我，起我、我所想。於一一毛\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0106b07\">0106b07</span>端處，盡未來劫修菩薩行；不著身，不著法，\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0106b08\">0106b08</span>不著念，不著願，不著三昧，不著觀察，不著寂\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0106b09\">0106b09</span>定，不著境界，不著教化調伏眾生，亦復不著\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0106b10\">0106b10</span>入於法界。何以故？菩薩作是念：『我應觀一切\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0106b11\">0106b11</span>法界如幻，諸佛如影，菩薩行如夢，佛說法如\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0106b12\">0106b12</span>響，一切世間如化，業報所持故；差別身如幻，\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0106b13\">0106b13</span>行力所起故；一切眾生如心，種種雜染故；一\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0106b14\">0106b14</span>切法如實際，不可變異故。』又作是念：『我當盡\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0106b15\">0106b15</span>虛空遍法界，於十方國土中行菩薩行，念念\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0106b16\">0106b16</span>明達，一切佛法正念現前，無所取著。』菩薩如\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0106b17\">0106b17</span>是觀身無我，見佛無礙，為化眾生，演說諸\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0106b18\">0106b18</span>法，令於佛法發生無量歡喜淨信，救護一\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0106b19\">0106b19</span>切，心無疲厭。無疲厭故，於一切世界，<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0106001\">（若）＋有【明】</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0106001\">有【大】，若有【明】</span><app n=\"0106001\"><p class=\"lg\">有</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【明】\">若有</rdg></app>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0106b20\">0106b20</span>眾生未<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0106002\">成熟＝成就【三】【宮】</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0106002\">成熟【大】，成就【宋】【元】【明】【宮】</span><app n=\"0106002\"><p class=\"lg\">成熟</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【宋】 【元】 【明】 【宮】\">成就</rdg></app>、未調伏處，悉詣於彼，方便化\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0106b21\">0106b21</span>度。其中眾生種種音聲、種種諸業、種種取\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0106b22\">0106b22</span>著、種種施設、種種和合、種種流轉、種種所\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0106b23\">0106b23</span>作、種種境界、種種生、種種沒，以大誓願，安\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0106b24\">0106b24</span>住其中而教化之，不令其心有動有退，亦不\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0106b25\">0106b25</span>一念生染著想。何以故？得無所著、無所依\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0106b26\">0106b26</span>故，自利、利他，清淨滿足。是名菩薩摩訶薩\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0106b27\">0106b27</span>第七無著行。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0106b28\">0106b28</span><p>「佛子！何等為菩薩摩訶薩難得行？此菩薩\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0106b29\">0106b29</span>成就難得善根、難伏善根、最勝善根、不可壞\r\n<p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0106c01\">0106c01</span>善根、無能過善根、不思議善根、無盡善根、\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0106c02\">0106c02</span>自在力善根、大威德善根、與一切佛同一性\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0106c03\">0106c03</span>善根。此菩薩修諸行時，於佛法中得最勝\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0106c04\">0106c04</span>解，於佛菩提得廣大解，於菩薩願未曾休\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0106c05\">0106c05</span>息，盡一切劫心無疲倦，於一切苦不生厭\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0106c06\">0106c06</span>離，一切眾魔所不能動，一切諸佛之所護\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0106c07\">0106c07</span>念，具行一切菩薩苦行，修菩薩行精勤匪\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0106c08\">0106c08</span>懈，於大乘願恒不退轉。是菩薩安住此難\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0106c09\">0106c09</span>得行已，於念念中，能轉阿僧祇劫生死，而不\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0106c10\">0106c10</span>捨菩薩大願。若有眾生，承事供養，乃至見聞，\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0106c11\">0106c11</span>皆於阿耨多羅三藐三菩提得不退轉。此菩\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0106c12\">0106c12</span>薩雖了眾生非有，而不捨一切眾生界。譬如\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0106c13\">0106c13</span>船師，不住此岸，不住彼岸，不住中流，而能運\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0106c14\">0106c14</span>度此岸眾生至於彼岸，以往返無休息故。菩\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0106c15\">0106c15</span>薩摩訶薩亦復如是，不住生死，不住涅槃，亦\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0106c16\">0106c16</span>復不住生死中流，而能運度此岸眾生，置於\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0106c17\">0106c17</span>彼岸安隱無畏、無憂惱處。亦不於眾生數而\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0106c18\">0106c18</span>有所著，不捨一眾生著多眾生，不捨多眾生\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0106c19\">0106c19</span>著一眾生；不增眾生界，不減眾生界；不生眾\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0106c20\">0106c20</span>生界，不滅眾生界；不盡眾生界，不長眾生界；\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0106c21\">0106c21</span>不分別眾生界，不二眾生界。何以故？菩薩深\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0106c22\">0106c22</span>入眾生界如法界，眾生界、法界無有二。無二\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0106c23\">0106c23</span>法中，無增、無減，無生、無滅，無有、無無，無取、無\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0106c24\">0106c24</span>依，無著、無二。何以故？菩薩了一切法、法界無\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0106c25\">0106c25</span>二故。菩薩如是以善方便入深法界，住於無\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0106c26\">0106c26</span>相，以清淨相莊嚴其身，了法無性而能分別\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0106c27\">0106c27</span>一切法相，不取眾生而能了知眾生之數，不\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0106c28\">0106c28</span>著世界而現身佛剎，不分別法而善入佛法，\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0106c29\">0106c29</span>深達義理而廣演言教，了一切法離欲真際\r\n<p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0107a01\">0107a01</span>而不斷菩薩道、不退菩薩行，常勤修習無盡\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0107a02\">0107a02</span>之行，自在入於清淨法界。譬如鑽木以出於\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0107a03\">0107a03</span>火，火事無量而火不滅。菩薩如是化眾生事，\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0107a04\">0107a04</span>無有窮盡，而在世間常住不滅；非究竟，非不\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0107a05\">0107a05</span>究竟；非取，非不取；非依，非無依；非世法，非\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0107a06\">0107a06</span>佛法；非凡夫，非得果。菩薩成就如是難得心，\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0107a07\">0107a07</span>修菩薩行時，不說二乘法，不說佛法；不說世\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0107a08\">0107a08</span>間，不說世間法；不說眾生，不說無眾生；不說\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0107a09\">0107a09</span>垢，不說淨。何以故？菩薩知一切法無染、無\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0107a10\">0107a10</span>取、不轉、不退故。菩薩於如是寂滅微妙甚深\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0107a11\">0107a11</span>最勝法中修行時，亦不生念：『我現修此行、已\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0107a12\">0107a12</span>修此行、當修此行。』不著蘊、界、處、內世間、外世\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0107a13\">0107a13</span>間、內外世間，所起大願、諸波羅蜜及一切法\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0107a14\">0107a14</span>皆無所著。何以故？法界中無有法名：向聲\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0107a15\">0107a15</span>聞乘、向獨覺乘，無有法名：向菩薩乘、向阿耨\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0107a16\">0107a16</span>多羅三藐三菩提，無有法名：向凡夫界，無有\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0107a17\">0107a17</span>法名：向染、向淨、向生死、向涅槃。何以故？諸法\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0107a18\">0107a18</span>無二、無不二故。譬如虛空，於十方中，若去、來、\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0107a19\">0107a19</span>今，求不可得，然非無虛空。菩薩如是觀一切\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0107a20\">0107a20</span>法皆不可得，然非無一切法；如實無異，不失\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0107a21\">0107a21</span>所作，普示修行菩薩諸行；不捨大願，調伏眾\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0107a22\">0107a22</span>生，轉正法輪；不壞因果，亦不違於平等妙法，\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0107a23\">0107a23</span>普與三世諸如來等；不斷佛種，不壞實相；深\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0107a24\">0107a24</span>入於法，辯才無盡；聞法不著，至法淵底；善能\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0107a25\">0107a25</span>開演，心無所畏；不捨佛住，不違世法，普現世\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0107a26\">0107a26</span>間而不著世間。菩薩如是成就難得智慧\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0107a27\">0107a27</span>心，修習諸行，於三惡趣拔出眾生，教化\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0107a28\">0107a28</span>調伏，安置三世諸佛道中，令不動搖。復作是\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0107a29\">0107a29</span>念：『世間眾生不知恩報，更相<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0107001\">雙＝讎【三】【宮】</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0107001\">讎【CB】【麗-CB】【宋】【元】【明】【宮】，雙【大】</span><app n=\"0107001\"><p class=\"lg\">讎<note type=\"cf1\">K08n0080_p0547a08</note></lem><rdg wit=\"【大】\">雙</rdg><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【宋】 【元】 【明】 【宮】\">讎</rdg></app>對，邪見執\r\n<p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0107b01\">0107b01</span>著，迷惑顛倒，愚癡無智，無有信心，隨逐惡\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0107b02\">0107b02</span>友，起諸惡慧，貪愛、無明、種種煩惱皆悉\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0107b03\">0107b03</span>充滿，是我所修菩薩行處。設有知恩、聰明、慧\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0107b04\">0107b04</span>解，及善知識充滿世間，我不於中修菩薩\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0107b05\">0107b05</span>行。何以故？我於眾生，無所適莫，無所冀望，\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0107b06\">0107b06</span>乃至不求一縷一毫，及以一字讚美之言。\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0107b07\">0107b07</span>盡未來劫，修菩薩行，未曾一念自為於<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0107b0701\">己【CB】【麗-CB】【磧-CB】，已【大】</span><app n=\"0107b0701\"><p class=\"lg\">己<note type=\"cf1\">K08n0080_p0547a14</note><note type=\"cf2\">Q07_p0799b14</note></lem><rdg wit=\"【大】\">已</rdg></app>；但\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0107b08\">0107b08</span>欲度脫一切眾生，令其清淨，永得出離。何\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0107b09\">0107b09</span>以故？於眾生中為明導者，法應如是，不取不\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0107b10\">0107b10</span>求；但為眾生修菩薩道，令其得至安隱彼岸，\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0107b11\">0107b11</span>成阿耨多羅三藐三菩提。』是名菩薩摩訶薩\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0107b12\">0107b12</span>第八難得行。</p><p>「佛子！何等為菩薩摩訶薩善\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0107b13\">0107b13</span>法行？此菩薩為一切世間天、人、魔、梵、沙門、婆\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0107b14\">0107b14</span>羅門、乾闥婆等作清涼法池，攝持正法，不斷\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0107b15\">0107b15</span>佛種；得清淨光明陀羅尼故，說法授記，辯才\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0107b16\">0107b16</span>無盡；得具足義陀羅尼故，義辯無盡；得覺悟\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0107b17\">0107b17</span>實法陀羅尼故，法辯無盡；得訓釋言<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0107002\">辭＝詞【三】【宮】＊</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0107002\">辭【大】＊，詞【宋】【元】【明】【宮】＊</span><app n=\"0107002\"><p class=\"lg\">辭</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【宋】 【元】 【明】 【宮】\">詞</rdg></app>陀\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0107b18\">0107b18</span>羅尼故，<app type=\"star\" corresp=\"#0107002\"><p class=\"lg\">辭</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【宋】 【元】 【明】 【宮】\">詞</rdg></app>辯無盡；得無邊文句無盡義\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0107b19\">0107b19</span>無礙門陀羅尼故，無礙辯無盡；得佛灌頂陀\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0107b20\">0107b20</span>羅尼灌其頂故，歡喜辯無盡；得不由他悟陀\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0107b21\">0107b21</span>羅尼門故，光明辯無盡；得同辯陀羅尼門故，\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0107b22\">0107b22</span>同辯無盡；得種種義身、句身、文身中訓釋陀\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0107b23\">0107b23</span>羅尼門故，訓釋辯無盡；得無邊旋陀羅尼故，\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0107b24\">0107b24</span>無邊辯無盡。<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0107003\">〔此〕－【宋】</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0107003\">此【大】，〔－〕【宋】</span><app n=\"0107003\"><p class=\"lg\">此</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【宋】\"><space quantity=\"0\"/></rdg></app>菩薩大悲堅固，普攝眾生，\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0107b25\">0107b25</span>於三千大千世界變身金色，施作佛事；隨諸\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0107b26\">0107b26</span>眾生根性欲樂，以廣長舌，於一音中現無量\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0107b27\">0107b27</span>音，應時說法，皆令歡喜。假使有不可說種種\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0107b28\">0107b28</span>業報無數眾生，共會一處，其會廣大充滿不\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0107b29\">0107b29</span>可說世界，菩薩於彼眾會中坐。是中眾生，一\r\n<p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0107c01\">0107c01</span>一皆有不可說阿僧祇口，一一口能出百千\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0107c02\">0107c02</span>億那由他音，同時發聲，各別言辭，各別所\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0107c03\">0107c03</span>問；菩薩於一念中，悉能領受，皆為酬對，令除\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0107c04\">0107c04</span>疑惑。如一眾會中，於不可說眾會中，悉亦如\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0107c05\">0107c05</span>是。復次，假使一毛端處，念念出不可說不可\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0107c06\">0107c06</span>說道場眾會；一切毛端處，皆亦如是。盡未來\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0107c07\">0107c07</span>劫，彼劫可盡，眾會無盡。是諸眾會，於念念\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0107c08\">0107c08</span>中，以各別言<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0107004\">辭＝詞【三】＊</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0107004\">辭【大】＊，詞【宋】＊【元】＊【明】＊</span><app n=\"0107004\"><p class=\"lg\">辭</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【宋】 【元】 【明】\">詞</rdg></app>，各別所問；菩薩於一念中，\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0107c09\">0107c09</span>悉能領受，無怖無怯，無疑無謬，而作是念：『設\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0107c10\">0107c10</span>一切眾生以如是語業俱來問我，我為說法\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0107c11\">0107c11</span>無斷無盡，皆令歡喜，住於善道；復令善解一\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0107c12\">0107c12</span>切言<app type=\"star\" corresp=\"#0107004\"><p class=\"lg\">辭</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【宋】 【元】 【明】\">詞</rdg></app>，能為眾生說種種法，而於言語無\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0107c13\">0107c13</span>所分別。假使不可說不可說種種言<app type=\"star\" corresp=\"#0107004\"><p class=\"lg\">辭</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【宋】 【元】 【明】\">詞</rdg></app>而\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0107c14\">0107c14</span>來問難，一念悉領，一音咸答，普使開悟，無有\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0107c15\">0107c15</span>遺餘。以得一切智灌頂故，以得無礙藏故，以\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0107c16\">0107c16</span>得一切法圓滿光明故，具足一切智智故。』佛\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0107c17\">0107c17</span>子！此菩薩摩訶薩安住善法行已，能自清淨，\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0107c18\">0107c18</span>亦能以無所著方便而普饒益一切眾生，不\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0107c19\">0107c19</span>見有眾生得出離者。如於此三千大千世界，\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0107c20\">0107c20</span>如是乃至於不可說三千大千世界，變身金\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0107c21\">0107c21</span>色，妙音具足，於一切法無所障礙而作佛\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0107c22\">0107c22</span>事。佛子！此菩薩摩訶薩成就十種身。所謂：\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0107c23\">0107c23</span>入無邊法界非趣身，滅一切<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0107005\">世間＝世門【宮】</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0107005\">世間【大】，世門【宮】</span><app n=\"0107005\"><p class=\"lg\">世間</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【宮】\">世門</rdg></app>故；入無\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0107c24\">0107c24</span>邊法界諸趣身，生一切世間故；不生身，住無\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0107c25\">0107c25</span>生平等法故；不滅身，一切滅、言說不可得故；\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0107c26\">0107c26</span>不實身，得如實故；不妄身，隨應現故；不\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0107c27\">0107c27</span>遷身，離死此生彼故；不壞身，法界性無壞故；\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0107c28\">0107c28</span>一相身，三世語言道斷故；無相身，善能觀察\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0107c29\">0107c29</span>法相故。菩薩成就如是十種身，為一切眾生\r\n<p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0108a01\">0108a01</span>舍，長養一切善根故；為一切眾生救，令其\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0108a02\">0108a02</span>得大安隱故；為一切眾生歸，與其作大依處\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0108a03\">0108a03</span>故；為一切眾生導，令得無上出離故；為一切\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0108a04\">0108a04</span>眾生師，令入真實法中故；為一切眾生燈，\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0108a05\">0108a05</span>令其明見業報故；為一切眾生光，令照甚深\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0108a06\">0108a06</span>妙法故；為一切三世炬，令其曉悟實法故；為\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0108a07\">0108a07</span>一切世間照，令入光明地中故；為一切諸趣\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0108a08\">0108a08</span>明，示現如來自在故。佛子！是名菩薩摩訶\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0108a09\">0108a09</span>薩第九善法行。菩薩安住此行，為一切眾\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0108a10\">0108a10</span>生作清涼法池，能盡一切佛法源故。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0108a11\">0108a11</span><p>「佛子！何等為菩薩摩訶薩真實行？此菩薩成\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0108a12\">0108a12</span>就第一誠諦之語，如說能行，如行能說。此\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0108a13\">0108a13</span>菩薩學三世諸佛真實語，入三世諸佛種性，\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0108a14\">0108a14</span>與三世諸佛善根同等，得三世諸佛無二語，\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0108a15\">0108a15</span>隨如來學智慧成就。此菩薩成就知眾生是\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0108a16\">0108a16</span>處非處智、去來現在業報智、諸根利鈍智、種\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0108a17\">0108a17</span>種界智、種種解智、一切至處道智、諸禪解脫\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0108a18\">0108a18</span>三昧垢淨起時非時智、一切世界宿住隨念\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0108a19\">0108a19</span>智、天眼智、漏盡智，而不捨一切菩薩行。何以\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0108a20\">0108a20</span>故？欲教化一切眾生，悉令清淨故。此菩薩復\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0108a21\">0108a21</span>生如是增上心：『若我不令一切眾生住無上\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0108a22\">0108a22</span>解脫道，而我先成阿耨多羅三藐三菩提者，\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0108a23\">0108a23</span>則違我本願，是所不應。是故，要當先令一切\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0108a24\">0108a24</span>眾生得無上菩提、無餘涅槃，然後成佛。何以\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0108a25\">0108a25</span>故？非眾生請我發心，我自為眾生作不請\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0108a26\">0108a26</span>之友，欲先令一切眾生滿足善根、成一切\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0108a27\">0108a27</span>智。是故，我為最勝，不著一切世間故；我為最\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0108a28\">0108a28</span>上，住無上調御地故；我為離翳，解眾生無際\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0108a29\">0108a29</span>故；我為已<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0108a2901\">辦【CB】【磧-CB】，辨【大】【麗-CB】</span><app n=\"0108a2901\"><p class=\"lg\">辦<note type=\"cf1\">Q07_p0800a02</note></lem><rdg wit=\"【大】\">辨</rdg><rdg wit=\"【麗-CB】\" resp=\"CBETA.maha\">辨<note type=\"cf1\">K08n0080_p0548a21</note></rdg></app>，本願成就故；我為善變化，菩薩\r\n<p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0108b01\">0108b01</span>功德莊嚴故；我為善依怙，三世諸佛攝受\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0108b02\">0108b02</span>故。』此菩薩摩訶薩不捨本願故，得入無上智\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0108b03\">0108b03</span>慧莊嚴，利益眾生，悉令滿足；隨本誓願，皆得\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0108b04\">0108b04</span>究竟；於一切法中智慧自在，令一切眾生普\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0108b05\">0108b05</span>得清淨；念念遍遊十方世界，念念普詣不可\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0108b06\">0108b06</span>說不可說諸佛國土，念念悉見不可說不可\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0108b07\">0108b07</span>說諸佛及佛莊嚴清淨國土，示現如來自在\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0108b08\">0108b08</span>神力。普遍法界、虛空界，此菩薩現無量身，\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0108b09\">0108b09</span>普入世間而無所依；於其身中，現一切剎、一\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0108b10\">0108b10</span>切眾生、一切諸法、一切諸佛。此菩薩知眾生\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0108b11\">0108b11</span>種種想、種種欲、種種解、種種業報、種種善\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0108b12\">0108b12</span>根，隨其所應，為現其身而調伏之；觀諸菩薩\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0108b13\">0108b13</span>如幻、一切法如化、佛出世如影、一切世間如\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0108b14\">0108b14</span>夢，得義身、文身無盡藏；正念自在，決定了知\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0108b15\">0108b15</span>一切諸法；智慧最勝，入一切三昧真實相，\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0108b16\">0108b16</span>住一性無二地。菩薩摩訶薩以諸眾生皆\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0108b17\">0108b17</span>著於二，安住大悲，修行如是寂滅之法，得佛\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0108b18\">0108b18</span>十力，入因陀羅網法界，成就如來無礙解\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0108b19\">0108b19</span>脫人中雄猛大師子吼；得無所畏，能轉無礙\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0108b20\">0108b20</span>清淨法輪；得智慧解脫，了知一切世間境\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0108b21\">0108b21</span>界；絕生死迴流，入智慧大海；為一切眾生護\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0108b22\">0108b22</span>持三世諸佛正法，到一切佛法海實相源底。\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0108b23\">0108b23</span>菩薩住此真實行已，一切世間天、人、魔、梵、沙\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0108b24\">0108b24</span>門、婆羅門、乾闥婆、阿脩羅等，有親近者，皆令\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0108b25\">0108b25</span>開悟，歡喜清淨。是名菩薩摩訶薩第十真\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0108b26\">0108b26</span>實行。」</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0108b27\">0108b27</span><p>爾時，佛神力故，十方各有佛剎微塵數世界\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0108b28\">0108b28</span>六種震動，所謂：動、遍動、等遍動，起、遍起、等\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0108b29\">0108b29</span>遍起，<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0108001\">涌＝踊【三】【宮】＊</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0108001\">涌【大】＊，踊【宋】【元】【明】【宮】＊</span><app n=\"0108001\"><p class=\"lg\">涌</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【宋】 【元】 【明】 【宮】\">踊</rdg></app>、遍<app type=\"star\" corresp=\"#0108001\"><p class=\"lg\">涌</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【宋】 【元】 【明】 【宮】\">踊</rdg></app>、等遍<app type=\"star\" corresp=\"#0108001\"><p class=\"lg\">涌</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【宋】 【元】 【明】 【宮】\">踊</rdg></app>，震、遍震、等遍震，\r\n<p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0108c01\">0108c01</span>吼、遍吼、等遍吼，擊、遍擊、等遍擊。雨天妙華、\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0108c02\">0108c02</span>天香、天末香、天鬘、天衣、天寶、天莊嚴具，奏天\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0108c03\">0108c03</span>樂音，放天光明，演暢諸天微妙音聲。如此\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0108c04\">0108c04</span>世界夜摩天宮，說十行法所現神變；十方世\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0108c05\">0108c05</span>界，悉亦如是。復以佛神力故，十方各過十萬\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0108c06\">0108c06</span>佛剎微塵數世界外，有十萬佛剎微塵數菩\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0108c07\">0108c07</span>薩俱，來詣此土，充滿十方，語功德林菩薩言：</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0108c08\">0108c08</span><p>「佛子！善哉！善哉！善能演說諸菩薩行。我等一\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0108c09\">0108c09</span>切同名：功德林，所住世界皆名：功德幢，彼土\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0108c10\">0108c10</span>如來同名：普功德。我等佛所，亦說此法；眾會\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0108c11\">0108c11</span>眷屬，言<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0108002\">辭＝詞【三】【宮】＊</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0108002\">辭【大】＊，詞【宋】【元】【明】【宮】＊</span><app n=\"0108002\"><p class=\"lg\">辭</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【宋】 【元】 【明】 【宮】\">詞</rdg></app>義理，悉亦如是，無有增減。佛子！\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0108c12\">0108c12</span>我等皆承佛神力，來入此會，為汝作證：十方\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0108c13\">0108c13</span>世界，悉亦如是。」</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0108c14\">0108c14</span><p>爾時，功德林菩薩承佛神力，普觀十方一切\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0108c15\">0108c15</span>眾會暨于法界，欲令佛種性不斷故，欲令菩\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0108c16\">0108c16</span>薩種性清淨故，欲令願種性不退轉故，欲令\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0108c17\">0108c17</span>行種性常相續故，欲令三世種性悉平等故，\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0108c18\">0108c18</span>欲攝三世一切佛種性故，欲開演所種諸善\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0108c19\">0108c19</span>根故，欲觀察一切諸<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0108003\">根＋（故）【元】【明】【宮】</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0108003\">根【大】，根故【元】【明】【宮】</span><app n=\"0108003\"><p class=\"lg\">根</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【元】 【明】 【宮】\">根故</rdg></app>、欲解、煩惱、習氣、心\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0108c20\">0108c20</span>行所作故，欲照了一切佛菩提故，而說頌\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0108c21\">0108c21</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0108004\">曰＝言【宮】</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0108004\">言【CB】【麗-CB】【宮】，曰【大】</span><app n=\"0108004\"><p class=\"lg\">言<note type=\"cf1\">K08n0080_p0548c21</note></lem><rdg wit=\"【大】\">曰</rdg><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【宮】\">言</rdg></app>：</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0108c22\">0108c22</span><p class=\"lg\"><p class=\"lg\">「一心敬禮十力尊，<caesura/>離垢清淨無礙見，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0108c23\">0108c23</span><p class=\"lg\">境界深遠無倫匹，<caesura/>住如虛空道中<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0108005\">者＝有【明】</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0108005\">者【大】，有【明】</span><app n=\"0108005\"><p class=\"lg\">者</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【明】\">有</rdg></app>。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0108c24\">0108c24</span><p class=\"lg\">過去人中諸最勝，<caesura/>功德無量無所著，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0108c25\">0108c25</span><p class=\"lg\">勇猛第一無等倫，<caesura/>彼離塵者行斯道。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0108c26\">0108c26</span><p class=\"lg\">現在十方諸國土，<caesura/>善能開演第一義，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0108c27\">0108c27</span><p class=\"lg\">離諸過惡最清淨，<caesura/>彼無依者行斯道。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0108c28\">0108c28</span><p class=\"lg\">未來所有人師子，<caesura/>周遍遊行於法界，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0108c29\">0108c29</span><p class=\"lg\">已發諸佛大悲心，<caesura/>彼饒益者行斯道。</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0109a01\">0109a01</span><p class=\"lg\">三世所有無比尊，<caesura/>自然除滅愚癡暗，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0109a02\">0109a02</span><p class=\"lg\">於一切法皆平等，<caesura/>彼大力人行此道。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0109a03\">0109a03</span><p class=\"lg\">普見無量無邊界，<caesura/>一切諸有及諸趣，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0109a04\">0109a04</span><p class=\"lg\">見已其心不分別，<caesura/>彼無動者行斯道。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0109a05\">0109a05</span><p class=\"lg\">法界所有皆明了，<caesura/>於第一義最清淨，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0109a06\">0109a06</span><p class=\"lg\">永破瞋慢及愚癡，<caesura/>彼功德者行斯道。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0109a07\">0109a07</span><p class=\"lg\">於諸眾生善分別，<caesura/>悉入法界真實性，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0109a08\">0109a08</span><p class=\"lg\">自然覺悟不由他，<caesura/>彼等空者行斯道。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0109a09\">0109a09</span><p class=\"lg\">盡空所有諸國土，<caesura/>悉往說法廣開<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0109001\">諭＝喻【宋】【宮】</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0109001\">諭【大】，喻【宋】【宮】</span><app n=\"0109001\"><p class=\"lg\">諭</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【宋】 【宮】\">喻</rdg></app>，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0109a10\">0109a10</span><p class=\"lg\">所說清淨無能壞，<caesura/>彼勝牟尼行此道。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0109a11\">0109a11</span><p class=\"lg\">具足堅固不退轉，<caesura/>成就尊重最勝法，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0109a12\">0109a12</span><p class=\"lg\">願力無盡到彼岸，<caesura/>彼善修者所行道。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0109a13\">0109a13</span><p class=\"lg\">無量無邊一切地，<caesura/>廣大甚深妙境界，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0109a14\">0109a14</span><p class=\"lg\">悉能知見靡有遺，<caesura/>彼論師子所行道。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0109a15\">0109a15</span><p class=\"lg\">一切句義皆明了，<caesura/>所有異論悉摧伏，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0109a16\">0109a16</span><p class=\"lg\">於法決定無所疑，<caesura/>彼大牟尼行此道。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0109a17\">0109a17</span><p class=\"lg\">遠離世間諸過患，<caesura/>普與眾生安隱樂，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0109a18\">0109a18</span><p class=\"lg\">能為無等大導師，<caesura/>彼勝德者行斯道。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0109a19\">0109a19</span><p class=\"lg\">恒以無<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0109a1901\">畏【CB】【麗-CB】，異【大】</span><app n=\"0109a1901\"><p class=\"lg\">畏<note type=\"cf1\">K08n0080_p0549a24</note></lem><rdg wit=\"【大】\">異</rdg></app>施眾生，<caesura/>普令一切皆欣慶，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0109a20\">0109a20</span><p class=\"lg\">其心清淨離染濁，<caesura/>彼無等者行斯道。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0109a21\">0109a21</span><p class=\"lg\">意業清淨極調善，<caesura/>離諸戲論無口過，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0109a22\">0109a22</span><p class=\"lg\">威光圓滿眾所欽，<caesura/>彼最勝者行斯道。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0109a23\">0109a23</span><p class=\"lg\">入真實義到彼岸，<caesura/>住功德處心永寂，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0109a24\">0109a24</span><p class=\"lg\">諸佛護念恒不忘，<caesura/>彼滅有者行斯道。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0109a25\">0109a25</span><p class=\"lg\">遠離於我無惱害，<caesura/>恒以大音宣正法，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0109a26\">0109a26</span><p class=\"lg\">十方國土靡不周，<caesura/>彼絕譬者行斯道。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0109a27\">0109a27</span><p class=\"lg\">檀波羅蜜已成滿，<caesura/>百福相好所莊嚴，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0109a28\">0109a28</span><p class=\"lg\">眾生見者皆欣悅，<caesura/>彼最勝慧行斯道。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0109a29\">0109a29</span><p class=\"lg\">智地甚深難可入，<caesura/>能以妙慧善安住，</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0109b01\">0109b01</span><p class=\"lg\">其心究竟不動搖，<caesura/>彼堅固行行斯道。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0109b02\">0109b02</span><p class=\"lg\">法界所有悉能入，<caesura/>隨所入處咸究竟，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0109b03\">0109b03</span><p class=\"lg\">神通自在靡不該，<caesura/>彼法光明行此道。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0109b04\">0109b04</span><p class=\"lg\">諸無等等大牟尼，<caesura/><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0109002\">勤修＝勤求【宮】</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0109002\">勤修【大】，勤求【宮】</span><app n=\"0109002\"><p class=\"lg\">勤修</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【宮】\">勤求</rdg></app>三昧無二相，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0109b05\">0109b05</span><p class=\"lg\">心常在定樂寂靜，<caesura/>彼普見者行斯道。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0109b06\">0109b06</span><p class=\"lg\">微細廣大諸國土，<caesura/>更相涉入各差別，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0109b07\">0109b07</span><p class=\"lg\">如其境界悉了知，<caesura/>彼智山王行此道。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0109b08\">0109b08</span><p class=\"lg\">意常明潔離諸垢，<caesura/>於三界中無所著，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0109b09\">0109b09</span><p class=\"lg\">護持眾戒到彼岸，<caesura/>此淨心者行斯道。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0109b10\">0109b10</span><p class=\"lg\">智慧無邊不可說，<caesura/>普遍法界虛空界，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0109b11\">0109b11</span><p class=\"lg\">善能修學住其中，<caesura/>彼金剛慧行斯道。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0109b12\">0109b12</span><p class=\"lg\">三世一切佛境界，<caesura/>智慧善入悉周遍，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0109b13\">0109b13</span><p class=\"lg\">未甞暫起疲厭心，<caesura/>彼最勝者行斯道。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0109b14\">0109b14</span><p class=\"lg\">善能分別十力法，<caesura/>了知一切至處道，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0109b15\">0109b15</span><p class=\"lg\">身業無礙得自在，<caesura/>彼功德身行此道。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0109b16\">0109b16</span><p class=\"lg\">十方無量無邊界，<caesura/>所有一切諸眾生，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0109b17\">0109b17</span><p class=\"lg\">我皆救護而不捨，<caesura/>彼無畏者行斯道。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0109b18\">0109b18</span><p class=\"lg\">於諸佛法勤修習，<caesura/>心常精進不懈倦，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0109b19\">0109b19</span><p class=\"lg\">淨治一切諸世間，<caesura/>彼大龍王行此道。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0109b20\">0109b20</span><p class=\"lg\">了知眾生根不同，<caesura/>欲解無量各差別，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0109b21\">0109b21</span><p class=\"lg\">種種諸界皆明達，<caesura/>此普入者行斯道。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0109b22\">0109b22</span><p class=\"lg\">十方世界無量剎，<caesura/>悉往受生無有數，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0109b23\">0109b23</span><p class=\"lg\">未曾一念生疲厭，<caesura/>彼歡喜者行斯道。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0109b24\">0109b24</span><p class=\"lg\">普放無量光明網，<caesura/>照耀一切諸世間，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0109b25\">0109b25</span><p class=\"lg\">其光所照入法性，<caesura/>此善慧者行斯道。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0109b26\">0109b26</span><p class=\"lg\">震動十方諸國土，<caesura/>無量億數那由他，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0109b27\">0109b27</span><p class=\"lg\">不令眾生有驚怖，<caesura/>此利世者所行道。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0109b28\">0109b28</span><p class=\"lg\">善解一切語言法，<caesura/>問難酬對悉究竟，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0109b29\">0109b29</span><p class=\"lg\">聰哲辯慧靡不知，<caesura/>此無畏者所行道。</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0109c01\">0109c01</span><p class=\"lg\">善解覆仰諸國土，<caesura/>分別思惟得究竟，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0109c02\">0109c02</span><p class=\"lg\">悉使住於無盡地，<caesura/>此勝慧者所行道。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0109c03\">0109c03</span><p class=\"lg\">功德無量那由他，<caesura/>為求佛道皆修習，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0109c04\">0109c04</span><p class=\"lg\">於其一切到彼岸，<caesura/>此無盡行所行道。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0109c05\">0109c05</span><p class=\"lg\">超出世間大論師，<caesura/>辯才第一師子吼，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0109c06\">0109c06</span><p class=\"lg\">普使群生到彼岸，<caesura/>此淨心者所行道。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0109c07\">0109c07</span><p class=\"lg\">諸佛灌頂第一法，<caesura/>已得此法灌其頂，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0109c08\">0109c08</span><p class=\"lg\">心恒安住正法門，<caesura/>彼廣大心行此道。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0109c09\">0109c09</span><p class=\"lg\">一切眾生無量別，<caesura/>了達其心悉周遍，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0109c10\">0109c10</span><p class=\"lg\">決定護持佛法藏，<caesura/>彼如須彌行此道。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0109c11\">0109c11</span><p class=\"lg\">能於一一語言中，<caesura/>普為示現無量音，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0109c12\">0109c12</span><p class=\"lg\">令彼眾生隨類解，<caesura/>此無礙見行斯道。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0109c13\">0109c13</span><p class=\"lg\">一切文字語言法，<caesura/>智皆善入不分別，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0109c14\">0109c14</span><p class=\"lg\">住於真實境界中，<caesura/>此見性者所行道。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0109c15\">0109c15</span><p class=\"lg\">安住甚深大法海，<caesura/>善能印定一切法，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0109c16\">0109c16</span><p class=\"lg\">了法無相真實門，<caesura/>此見實者所行道。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0109c17\">0109c17</span><p class=\"lg\">一一佛土皆往詣，<caesura/>盡於無量無邊劫，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0109c18\">0109c18</span><p class=\"lg\">觀察思惟靡暫停，<caesura/>此匪懈者所行道。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0109c19\">0109c19</span><p class=\"lg\">無量無數諸如來，<caesura/>種種<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0109c1901\">名【CB】【麗-CB】【磧-CB】，各【大】</span><app n=\"0109c1901\"><p class=\"lg\">名<note type=\"cf1\">K08n0080_p0550a09</note><note type=\"cf2\">Q07_p0801c14</note></lem><rdg wit=\"【大】\">各</rdg></app>號各不同，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0109c20\">0109c20</span><p class=\"lg\">於一毛端悉明見，<caesura/>此淨福者所行道。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0109c21\">0109c21</span><p class=\"lg\">一毛端處見諸佛，<caesura/>其數無量不可說，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0109c22\">0109c22</span><p class=\"lg\">一切法界悉亦然，<caesura/>彼諸佛子行斯道。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0109c23\">0109c23</span><p class=\"lg\">無量無邊無數劫，<caesura/>於一念中悉明見，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0109c24\">0109c24</span><p class=\"lg\">知其修促無定相，<caesura/>此解脫行所行道。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0109c25\">0109c25</span><p class=\"lg\">能令見者無空過，<caesura/>皆於佛法種因緣，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0109c26\">0109c26</span><p class=\"lg\">而於所作心無著，<caesura/>彼諸最勝所行道。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0109c27\">0109c27</span><p class=\"lg\">那由他劫常遇佛，<caesura/>終不一念生疲厭，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0109c28\">0109c28</span><p class=\"lg\">其心歡喜轉更增，<caesura/>此不空見所行道。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0109c29\">0109c29</span><p class=\"lg\">盡於無量無邊劫，<caesura/>觀察一切眾生界，</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0110a01\">0110a01</span><p class=\"lg\">未曾見有一眾生，<caesura/>此堅固士所行道。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0110a02\">0110a02</span><p class=\"lg\">修習無邊福智藏，<caesura/>普作清涼功德池，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0110a03\">0110a03</span><p class=\"lg\">利益一切諸群生，<caesura/>彼第一人行此道。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0110a04\">0110a04</span><p class=\"lg\">法界所有諸品類，<caesura/>普遍虛空無數量，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0110a05\">0110a05</span><p class=\"lg\">了彼皆依言說住，<caesura/>此師子吼所行道。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0110a06\">0110a06</span><p class=\"lg\">能於一一三昧中，<caesura/>普入無數諸三昧，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0110a07\">0110a07</span><p class=\"lg\">悉至法門幽奧處，<caesura/>此論月者行斯道。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0110a08\">0110a08</span><p class=\"lg\">忍力勤修到彼岸，<caesura/>能忍最勝寂滅法，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0110a09\">0110a09</span><p class=\"lg\">其心平等不動搖，<caesura/>此無邊智所行道。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0110a10\">0110a10</span><p class=\"lg\">於一世界一坐處，<caesura/>其身不動恒寂然，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0110a11\">0110a11</span><p class=\"lg\">而於一切普現身，<caesura/>彼無邊身行此道。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0110a12\">0110a12</span><p class=\"lg\">無量無邊諸國土，<caesura/>悉令共入一塵中，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0110a13\">0110a13</span><p class=\"lg\">普得包容無障礙，<caesura/>彼無邊思行此道。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0110a14\">0110a14</span><p class=\"lg\">了達是處及非處，<caesura/>於諸力處普能入，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0110a15\">0110a15</span><p class=\"lg\">成就如來最上力，<caesura/>彼第一力所行道。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0110a16\">0110a16</span><p class=\"lg\">過去未來現在世，<caesura/>無量無邊諸業報，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0110a17\">0110a17</span><p class=\"lg\">恒以智慧悉了知，<caesura/>此達解者所行道。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0110a18\">0110a18</span><p class=\"lg\">了達世間時非時，<caesura/>如應調伏諸眾生，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0110a19\">0110a19</span><p class=\"lg\">悉順其宜而不失，<caesura/>此善了者所行道。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0110a20\">0110a20</span><p class=\"lg\">善守身語及意業，<caesura/>恒令依法而修行，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0110a21\">0110a21</span><p class=\"lg\">離諸取著降眾魔，<caesura/>此智心者所行道。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0110a22\">0110a22</span><p class=\"lg\">於諸法中得善巧，<caesura/>能入真如平等處，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0110a23\">0110a23</span><p class=\"lg\">辯才宣說無有窮，<caesura/>此佛行者所行道。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0110a24\">0110a24</span><p class=\"lg\">陀羅尼門已圓滿，<caesura/>善能安住無礙藏，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0110a25\">0110a25</span><p class=\"lg\">於諸法界悉通達，<caesura/>此深入者所行道。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0110a26\">0110a26</span><p class=\"lg\">三世所有一切佛，<caesura/>悉與等心同智慧，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0110a27\">0110a27</span><p class=\"lg\">一性一相無有殊，<caesura/>此無礙種所行道。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0110a28\">0110a28</span><p class=\"lg\">已<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0110001\">決＝抉【明】</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0110001\">決【大】，抉【明】</span><app n=\"0110001\"><p class=\"lg\">決</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【明】\">抉</rdg></app>一切愚癡膜，<caesura/>深入廣大智慧海，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0110a29\">0110a29</span><p class=\"lg\">普施眾生清淨眼，<caesura/>此有目者所行道。</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0110b01\">0110b01</span><p class=\"lg\">已具一切諸導師，<caesura/>平等神通無二行，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0110b02\">0110b02</span><p class=\"lg\">獲於如來自在力，<caesura/>此善修者所行道。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0110b03\">0110b03</span><p class=\"lg\">遍遊一切諸世間，<caesura/>普雨無邊妙法雨，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0110b04\">0110b04</span><p class=\"lg\">悉令於義得決<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0110002\">了＝示【明】</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0110002\">了【大】，示【明】</span><app n=\"0110002\"><p class=\"lg\">了</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【明】\">示</rdg></app>，<caesura/>此法雲者所行道。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0110b05\">0110b05</span><p class=\"lg\">能於佛智及解脫，<caesura/>深生淨信永不退，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0110b06\">0110b06</span><p class=\"lg\">以信而生智慧根，<caesura/>此善學者所行道。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0110b07\">0110b07</span><p class=\"lg\">能於一念悉了知，<caesura/>一切眾生無有餘，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0110b08\">0110b08</span><p class=\"lg\">了彼眾生心自性，<caesura/>達無性者所行道。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0110b09\">0110b09</span><p class=\"lg\">法界一切諸國土，<caesura/>悉能化往無有數，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0110b10\">0110b10</span><p class=\"lg\">其身最妙絕等倫，<caesura/>此無比行所行道。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0110b11\">0110b11</span><p class=\"lg\">佛剎無邊無有數，<caesura/>無量諸佛在其中，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0110b12\">0110b12</span><p class=\"lg\">菩薩於彼悉現前，<caesura/>親近供養生尊重。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0110b13\">0110b13</span><p class=\"lg\">菩薩能以獨一身，<caesura/>入於三昧而寂定，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0110b14\">0110b14</span><p class=\"lg\">令見其身無有數，<caesura/>一一皆從三昧起。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0110b15\">0110b15</span><p class=\"lg\">菩薩所住最深妙，<caesura/>所行所作超戲論，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0110b16\">0110b16</span><p class=\"lg\">其心清淨常悅樂，<caesura/>能令眾生悉歡喜。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0110b17\">0110b17</span><p class=\"lg\">諸根方便各差別，<caesura/>能以智慧悉明見，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0110b18\">0110b18</span><p class=\"lg\">而了諸根無所依，<caesura/>調難調者所行道。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0110b19\">0110b19</span><p class=\"lg\">能以方便巧分別，<caesura/>於一切法得自在，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0110b20\">0110b20</span><p class=\"lg\">十方世界各不同，<caesura/>悉在其中作佛事。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0110b21\">0110b21</span><p class=\"lg\">諸根微妙行亦然，<caesura/>能為眾生廣說法，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0110b22\">0110b22</span><p class=\"lg\">誰其聞者不欣慶，<caesura/>此等虛空所行道。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0110b23\">0110b23</span><p class=\"lg\">智眼清淨無與等，<caesura/>於一切法悉明見，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0110b24\">0110b24</span><p class=\"lg\">如是智慧巧分別，<caesura/>此無等者所行道。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0110b25\">0110b25</span><p class=\"lg\">所有無盡廣大福，<caesura/>一切修行使究竟，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0110b26\">0110b26</span><p class=\"lg\">令諸眾生悉清淨，<caesura/>此無比者所行道。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0110b27\">0110b27</span><p class=\"lg\">普勸修成助道法，<caesura/>悉令得住方便地，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0110b28\">0110b28</span><p class=\"lg\">度脫眾生無有數，<caesura/>未曾暫起眾生想。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0110b29\">0110b29</span><p class=\"lg\">一切機緣悉觀察，<caesura/>先護彼意令無諍，</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0110c01\">0110c01</span><p class=\"lg\">普示眾生安隱處，<caesura/>此方便者所行道。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0110c02\">0110c02</span><p class=\"lg\">成就最上第一智，<caesura/>具足無量無邊智，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0110c03\">0110c03</span><p class=\"lg\">於諸四眾無所畏，<caesura/>此方便智所行道。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0110c04\">0110c04</span><p class=\"lg\">一切世界及諸法，<caesura/>悉能遍入得自在，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0110c05\">0110c05</span><p class=\"lg\">亦入一切眾會中，<caesura/>度脫群生無有數。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0110c06\">0110c06</span><p class=\"lg\">十方一切國土中，<caesura/>擊大法鼓悟群生，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0110c07\">0110c07</span><p class=\"lg\"><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0110c0701\">為【CB】【麗-CB】【磧-CB】，所【大】</span><app n=\"0110c0701\"><p class=\"lg\">為<note type=\"cf1\">K08n0080_p0551a12</note><note type=\"cf2\">Q07_p0802b29</note></lem><rdg wit=\"【大】\">所</rdg></app>法施主最無上，<caesura/>此不滅者所行道。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0110c08\">0110c08</span><p class=\"lg\">一身結跏而正坐，<caesura/>充滿十方無量剎，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0110c09\">0110c09</span><p class=\"lg\">而令其身不迫隘，<caesura/>此法身者所行道。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0110c10\">0110c10</span><p class=\"lg\">能於一義一文中，<caesura/>演說無量無邊法，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0110c11\">0110c11</span><p class=\"lg\">而<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0110003\">其＝於【三】</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0110003\">其【大】，於【宋】【元】【明】</span><app n=\"0110003\"><p class=\"lg\">其</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【宋】 【元】 【明】\">於</rdg></app>邊際不可得，<caesura/>此無邊智所行道。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0110c12\">0110c12</span><p class=\"lg\">於佛解脫善修學，<caesura/>得佛智慧無障礙，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0110c13\">0110c13</span><p class=\"lg\">成就無畏為世雄，<caesura/>此方便者所行道。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0110c14\">0110c14</span><p class=\"lg\">了知十方世界海，<caesura/>亦知一切佛剎海，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0110c15\">0110c15</span><p class=\"lg\">智海法海悉了知，<caesura/>眾生見者咸欣慶。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0110c16\">0110c16</span><p class=\"lg\">或現入胎及初生，<caesura/>或現道場成正覺，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0110c17\">0110c17</span><p class=\"lg\">如是皆令世間見，<caesura/>此無邊者所行道。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0110c18\">0110c18</span><p class=\"lg\">無量億數國土中，<caesura/>示現其身入涅槃，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0110c19\">0110c19</span><p class=\"lg\">實不捨願歸寂滅，<caesura/>此雄論者所行道。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0110c20\">0110c20</span><p class=\"lg\">堅固微密一妙身，<caesura/>與佛平等無差別，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0110c21\">0110c21</span><p class=\"lg\">隨諸眾生各異見，<caesura/>一實身者所行道。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0110c22\">0110c22</span><p class=\"lg\">法界平等無差別，<caesura/>具足無量無邊義，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0110c23\">0110c23</span><p class=\"lg\">樂觀一相心不移，<caesura/>三世智者所行道。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0110c24\">0110c24</span><p class=\"lg\">於諸眾生及佛法，<caesura/>建立加持悉究竟，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0110c25\">0110c25</span><p class=\"lg\">所有持力同於佛，<caesura/>最上持者行斯道。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0110c26\">0110c26</span><p class=\"lg\">神足無礙猶如佛，<caesura/>天眼無礙最清淨，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0110c27\">0110c27</span><p class=\"lg\">耳根無礙善聽聞，<caesura/>此無礙意所行道。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0110c28\">0110c28</span><p class=\"lg\">所有神通皆具足，<caesura/>隨其智慧悉成就，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0110c29\">0110c29</span><p class=\"lg\">善知一切靡所儔，<caesura/>此賢智者所行道。</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0111a01\">0111a01</span><p class=\"lg\">其心正定不搖動，<caesura/>其智廣大無邊際，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0111a02\">0111a02</span><p class=\"lg\">所有境界皆明達，<caesura/>一切見者所行道。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0111a03\">0111a03</span><p class=\"lg\">已到一切功德岸，<caesura/>能隨次第度眾生，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0111a04\">0111a04</span><p class=\"lg\">其心畢竟無厭足，<caesura/>此常勤者所行道。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0111a05\">0111a05</span><p class=\"lg\">三世所有諸佛法，<caesura/>於此一切咸知見，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0111a06\">0111a06</span><p class=\"lg\">從於如來種性生，<caesura/>彼諸佛子行斯道。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0111a07\">0111a07</span><p class=\"lg\">隨順言<app type=\"star\" corresp=\"#0108002\"><p class=\"lg\">辭</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【宋】 【元】 【明】 【宮】\">詞</rdg></app>已成就，<caesura/>乖違談論善摧伏，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0111a08\">0111a08</span><p class=\"lg\">常能趣向佛菩提，<caesura/>無邊慧者所行道。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0111a09\">0111a09</span><p class=\"lg\">一光照觸無涯限，<caesura/>十方國土悉充遍，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0111a10\">0111a10</span><p class=\"lg\">普使世間得大明，<caesura/>此破闇者所行道。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0111a11\">0111a11</span><p class=\"lg\">隨其應見應供養，<caesura/>為現如來清淨身，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0111a12\">0111a12</span><p class=\"lg\">教化眾生百千億，<caesura/>莊嚴佛剎亦如是。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0111a13\">0111a13</span><p class=\"lg\">為令眾生出世間，<caesura/>一切妙行皆修習，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0111a14\">0111a14</span><p class=\"lg\">此行廣大無邊際，<caesura/>云何而有能知者？</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0111a15\">0111a15</span><p class=\"lg\">假使分身不可說，<caesura/>而與法界虛空等，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0111a16\">0111a16</span><p class=\"lg\">悉共稱揚彼功德，<caesura/>百千萬劫無能盡。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0111a17\">0111a17</span><p class=\"lg\">菩薩功德無有邊，<caesura/>一切修行皆具足，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0111a18\">0111a18</span><p class=\"lg\">假使無量無邊佛，<caesura/>於無量劫說不盡。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0111a19\">0111a19</span><p class=\"lg\">何況世間天及人，<caesura/>一切聲聞及緣覺，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0111a20\">0111a20</span><p class=\"lg\">能於無量無邊劫，<caesura/>讚歎稱揚得究竟。」</p></lg></cb:div>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0111a21\">0111a21</span><cb:juan n=\"020\" fun=\"close\"><cb:jhead><title>大方廣佛華嚴經</title>卷第二十</cb:jhead></cb:juan>\r\n</body>"
    }
  ],
  "version": "CBReader 2X v0.9.9 2026-01-21"
}